# Keep LF everywhere: scripts run inside WSL/BusyBox and CRLF breaks them.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.img binary
*.xrgb binary
# The Doors graphics packages are kept byte-for-byte as supplied, so the hashes
# in docs/design/brand/README.md and in each package's own README/SHA256SUMS
# stay true (the first two packages' OFL texts have CRLF endings).
docs/design/brand/doors-threshold/** -text
docs/design/brand/doors-icon-extension/** -text
docs/design/brand/doors-visual-pack-v1/** -text
